2026-02-08T23:11:44.521163Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019c3f71-332f-7602-9a18-853a805cb392}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec_command {"cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport re, pathlib\ntext=pathlib.Path('Use Cases_Scenarios_ATs.md').read_text()\nuc_pat=re.compile(r'^# (UC-\\d{2}) — (.+)$', re.M)\nucs=[]\nfor m in uc_pat.finditer(text):\n    ucs.append((m.group(1), m.start()))\nucs2=[]\nfor i,(uc_id,start) in enumerate(ucs):\n    end=ucs[i+1][1] if i+1<len(ucs) else len(text)\n    block=text[start:end]\n    at_ids=re.findall(r'^### (AT-UC-\\d{2}-\\d{2})', block, re.M)\n    ucs2.append((uc_id,at_ids))\nfor uc_id,at_ids in ucs2:\n    if uc_id in ['UC-03','UC-05','UC-07','UC-08','UC-09','UC-10','UC-12','UC-14','UC-15','UC-16','UC-17','UC-18','UC-19','UC-20','UC-21']:\n        print(uc_id, at_ids[:6])\nPY","workdir":"/Users/Goku/Desktop/Code/Personal-Library/ECE493/ECE493Lab2"} thread_id=019c3f71-332f-7602-9a18-853a805cb392
